**DESIGN D2: the test rows, in `api/tests/HpsmPoc.Api.Tests/Hosting/ForwardedProofTests.cs` only.**
- Add `using HpsmPoc.Api.Tests.Support;` and `using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;`.
